WEBVTT

00:01.501 --> 00:04.838
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:32.258 --> 01:33.425
THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.

01:33.426 --> 01:34.928
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

01:50.819 --> 01:53.822
What are you doing, Lord Jinshi?

01:55.073 --> 01:56.991
No! This isn't what it looks like!

02:00.870 --> 02:03.373
Lord Jinshi, your face.

02:04.624 --> 02:07.293
It is nothing serious. Just a scratch.

02:09.420 --> 02:10.964
Let me see.

02:17.804 --> 02:19.139
Excuse me.

02:25.562 --> 02:27.689
It's been stitched rather carelessly.

02:28.314 --> 02:31.901
<i>I would redo it right away,
but my hands are too tired.</i>

02:34.279 --> 02:35.572
Did you go to the front lines?

02:36.156 --> 02:38.950
I could hardly sit in a safe place
and just watch.

02:39.492 --> 02:42.995
I think that's fine.
That is your position, after all.

02:42.996 --> 02:46.331
Please do not go to dangerous places
on purpose.

02:46.332 --> 02:49.586
When you get hurt,
it causes trouble for everyone around you.

02:51.087 --> 02:52.046
True.

02:53.089 --> 02:55.300
I did not intend to get injured.

02:58.553 --> 03:00.138
No one ever does.

03:05.810 --> 03:08.271
I accepted a strange request, that is all.

03:11.608 --> 03:14.694
Were you close with Loulan?

03:18.531 --> 03:19.908
Were you friends?

03:21.826 --> 03:24.913
I am not really sure.

03:26.205 --> 03:27.165
<i>Friends?</i>

03:28.207 --> 03:33.421
<i>At the very least, I think
it was something close to that for me.</i>

03:34.130 --> 03:36.674
<i>Spending time talking with Loulan,</i>

03:37.967 --> 03:40.010
<i>with Shisui and Xiaolan,</i>

03:40.011 --> 03:41.554
<i>it was not so bad.</i>

03:43.431 --> 03:47.018
<i>Although I do not know how Shisui felt.</i>

03:49.062 --> 03:52.899
She was truly hard to understand.

03:55.068 --> 03:56.402
I feel the same.

04:01.532 --> 04:03.785
I never did figure her out.

04:04.994 --> 04:06.287
I see.

04:07.205 --> 04:09.791
<i>So, Shisui.</i>

04:11.501 --> 04:13.294
I leave the rest to you.

04:14.921 --> 04:16.506
<i>The only thing I can do</i>

04:17.215 --> 04:20.134
<i>is carry out what she entrusted to me.</i>

04:20.969 --> 04:21.970
<i>That is all.</i>

04:26.641 --> 04:27.558
It is done.

04:28.768 --> 04:29.685
Thank you.

04:29.686 --> 04:33.230
You look terrible. You should rest.

04:33.231 --> 04:35.440
Yeah. I am really sleepy.

04:35.441 --> 04:37.818
Please do not fall asleep here.

04:37.819 --> 04:39.945
Why not? I am tired.

04:39.946 --> 04:41.698
If you must ask.

04:42.282 --> 04:44.116
This place is tainted.

04:44.117 --> 04:45.201
I know that.

04:46.286 --> 04:47.662
In that case.

04:55.670 --> 04:57.337
<i>His hand.</i>

04:57.338 --> 04:59.048
<i>It is so cold.</i>

04:59.757 --> 05:02.427
Then why are you here?

05:03.594 --> 05:06.346
Even I can feel pity for children.

05:06.347 --> 05:09.725
Is that so? But did your herbal master not

05:09.726 --> 05:12.061
forbid you from touching corpses?

05:13.146 --> 05:14.980
<i>He remembered that?</i>

05:14.981 --> 05:19.818
Which makes it hard to believe you would
stay in a place like this for long.

05:19.819 --> 05:21.904
<i>Sharp intuition
when it is least convenient.</i>

05:24.532 --> 05:27.160
<i>How should I cover this up?</i>

05:29.245 --> 05:30.620
What happened to your wound?

05:30.621 --> 05:32.957
There was an unpleasant person.

05:34.000 --> 05:35.208
You were attacked?

05:35.209 --> 05:36.960
By a woman.

05:36.961 --> 05:41.424
<i>What is it with him? Why must he meddle
in matters of other people's chastity?</i>

05:43.092 --> 05:44.927
Will it leave a scar?

05:45.762 --> 05:47.513
This much will fade quickly.

05:48.389 --> 05:49.682
Do not let it scar.

05:50.475 --> 05:53.895
May I return those words to you?

05:55.730 --> 05:57.607
I am a man. It does not matter.

05:58.232 --> 06:00.942
Lord Jinshi, you are beyond that.

06:00.943 --> 06:02.569
I do not care.

06:02.570 --> 06:04.613
Then I do not either.

06:04.614 --> 06:06.783
If one scar could ruin my value,

06:07.366 --> 06:08.701
then I lacked worth.

06:14.207 --> 06:15.041
Hey.

06:16.125 --> 06:17.043
Am I a man

06:18.086 --> 06:20.880
whose value disappears
with a single scratch?

06:22.090 --> 06:23.883
Am I just a pretty face
with nothing inside?

06:29.055 --> 06:30.181
If anything,

06:30.765 --> 06:33.935
a few more scars might suit you.

06:34.769 --> 06:37.063
<i>Lord Jinshi is too beautiful.</i>

06:37.688 --> 06:40.065
<i>Because of that,
people around him become flustered,</i>

06:40.066 --> 06:42.360
<i>focused only on his appearance.</i>

06:42.944 --> 06:47.197
<i>But his true nature is not
as flashy as his looks.</i>

06:47.198 --> 06:48.741
<i>It is something far more honest.</i>

06:49.450 --> 06:53.621
<i>That probably has more value than beauty.</i>

06:55.456 --> 06:58.126
I would say,
you are more handsome than ever.

07:09.345 --> 07:10.804
What is it?

07:10.805 --> 07:13.891
I was trying to restrain myself,
considering the circumstances.

07:15.101 --> 07:17.937
If you are sleepy, you should--

07:20.606 --> 07:22.859
I thought I could stay calm.

07:23.860 --> 07:26.319
- Huh?
- But it turns out,

07:26.320 --> 07:28.030
I did better than expected.

07:30.074 --> 07:31.701
<i>What is this situation?</i>

07:32.368 --> 07:36.079
Lord Jinshi, perhaps you really
should get some rest?

07:36.080 --> 07:37.414
I am still fine.

07:37.415 --> 07:39.166
Then I will get some painkillers.

07:39.167 --> 07:41.668
I can hold on for 30 more minutes.

07:41.669 --> 07:43.588
Thirty minutes, for what?

07:44.922 --> 07:47.049
<i>What nonsense is he spouting
with that worn-out face?</i>

07:50.636 --> 07:51.888
<i>I can't.</i>

07:55.141 --> 07:56.267
What was that sound just now?

07:59.896 --> 08:00.855
Hey!

08:04.066 --> 08:05.067
No!

08:09.113 --> 08:10.406
It is not that!

08:22.126 --> 08:23.002
It's medicine.

08:23.878 --> 08:26.963
<i>Shisui called it a medicine, not a poison.</i>

08:26.964 --> 08:30.635
<i>A medicine that kills once,
then brings one back,</i>

08:31.302 --> 08:33.054
<i>"A medicine to revive the dead."</i>

08:43.523 --> 08:44.357
She is alive?

08:44.941 --> 08:48.151
Lord Jinshi!
Please prepare some hot water!

08:48.152 --> 08:51.739
And something warm!
Clothes, food, anything!

08:52.782 --> 08:55.868
<i>I don't know what Lord Jinshi will do
with the revived child.</i>

08:56.452 --> 08:59.705
<i>Still, this is why I was brought here.</i>

09:01.123 --> 09:02.832
One who died once.

09:02.833 --> 09:07.046
Then, you will let
"those who died once" go?

09:08.714 --> 09:10.173
It feels like I've been tricked by a fox.

09:10.174 --> 09:13.010
- Lord Jinshi!
- I got it.

09:20.059 --> 09:22.687
Hey! Bring warm water in a bucket!
And blankets!

09:23.312 --> 09:25.314
- Also prepare some warm drinks!
- Yes!

09:28.776 --> 09:29.610
Lord Jinshi!

09:37.034 --> 09:39.744
Send some people over!
If possible, Suirei!

09:39.745 --> 09:42.415
- Gaoshun, please.
- Got it.

09:56.095 --> 09:57.804
We'll set up here.

09:57.805 --> 09:59.390
Thank you very much.

10:02.018 --> 10:04.145
Shall we continue this later?

10:05.521 --> 10:06.439
Yes, yes.

10:16.949 --> 10:17.825
Suirei.

10:19.827 --> 10:21.329
The children have come back to life.

10:24.665 --> 10:25.666
Hey!

10:47.521 --> 10:50.066
It's a happy start to the new year,
isn't it?

10:50.775 --> 10:53.401
I hear the Crown Prince
is finally being presented?

10:53.402 --> 10:54.694
It seems so.

10:54.695 --> 10:58.657
With all the celebrations, the guests are
spending generously.

10:58.658 --> 11:01.285
Granny is happily counting her money.

11:05.748 --> 11:11.170
The new Empress was confirmed as Consort
Gyokuyou, Maomao's former mistress.

11:24.100 --> 11:25.476
<i>The birth went smoothly.</i>

11:26.143 --> 11:29.980
<i>Old man didn't return to the pleasure
district, he chose to stay in the palace.</i>

11:30.564 --> 11:34.526
<i>He was exiled from the rear palace
for absurd reasons to begin with.</i>

11:34.527 --> 11:36.986
<i>But his skills as a physician
are exceptional.</i>

11:36.987 --> 11:39.907
<i>Naturally, they would not want
to send him back.</i>

11:43.619 --> 11:45.871
<i>As for Lord Jinshi,
I have not seen him since that day.</i>

11:46.455 --> 11:50.292
<i>He's probably busy handling the affairs of
the Shi clan and with his regular duties.</i>

11:52.628 --> 11:54.713
<i>Good news, in a way.</i>

11:56.006 --> 11:59.343
<i>But it also meant I was no longer
needed in the rear palace.</i>

12:01.178 --> 12:04.848
<i>Nonetheless, the pleasure district
is busier anyway.</i>

12:04.849 --> 12:08.393
<i>The medicines the old man stockpiled
are long gone.</i>

12:08.394 --> 12:11.020
Hey, Freckles! Give me a snack!

12:11.021 --> 12:13.022
Don't run around too much.

12:13.023 --> 12:15.316
You were bedridden not too long ago, remember?

12:15.317 --> 12:17.235
I'm fine now!

12:17.236 --> 12:20.114
<i>All five children
came back to life after that.</i>

12:21.198 --> 12:24.368
<i>He was the last to awaken.</i>

12:25.995 --> 12:28.372
The medicine is still experimental.

12:29.081 --> 12:32.501
Truthfully, I wanted to wait
until it was proven effective.

12:33.461 --> 12:36.754
<i>The last one, Kyou-u, lost his memory</i>

12:36.755 --> 12:39.008
<i>and suffered minor paralysis on one side.</i>

12:39.884 --> 12:44.597
<i>Even so, coming back from that state
is a miracle.</i>

12:45.681 --> 12:49.560
<i>The other children were all given
new names and allowed to live on.</i>

12:50.394 --> 12:54.856
<i>I don't know why,
but the four who awoke earlier</i>

12:54.857 --> 12:57.233
<i>were apparently taken in by Lady Ah-Duo,</i>

12:57.234 --> 12:59.445
<i>a former high-ranking consort.</i>

13:00.696 --> 13:02.239
<i>And Suirei too.</i>

13:04.074 --> 13:06.826
<i>Though she had stirred up
much trouble in the palace,</i>

13:06.827 --> 13:09.914
<i>her case was seen with leniency.</i>

13:10.748 --> 13:12.749
<i>She carries the previous Emperor's blood.</i>

13:12.750 --> 13:15.252
<i>She is now under surveillance,
but her life was spared.</i>

13:16.128 --> 13:18.254
<i>As for Kyou-u, because of his memory loss,</i>

13:18.255 --> 13:21.424
<i>it was decided he'd be raised separately,</i>

13:21.425 --> 13:24.178
<i>and so he was brought
to the pleasure district.</i>

13:24.929 --> 13:29.308
<i>But what kind of logic is it that,
"In a way, this is the safest place"?</i>

13:29.808 --> 13:31.602
There it is! Ow!

13:32.520 --> 13:33.770
What was that for?

13:33.771 --> 13:35.940
Don't eat without asking, you dumb Chou-u.

13:36.815 --> 13:39.985
<i>Kyou-u is now called Chou-u. A new name.</i>

13:40.569 --> 13:44.489
<i>Since he still remembered the sound of
his old name, it was the best we could do.</i>

13:44.490 --> 13:46.741
Chou-u, over here.

13:46.742 --> 13:48.827
Yay! Play with me!

13:55.626 --> 13:57.002
Seki-u?

13:58.379 --> 13:59.672
Long time no see.

14:01.298 --> 14:03.299
I heard you were an apothecary,

14:03.300 --> 14:05.593
but didn't expect your store
to be in the pleasure district.

14:05.594 --> 14:07.763
Has the Crown Prince
been presented already?

14:08.389 --> 14:12.267
Yes, and it went smoothly.
Everyone gave their best regards to you.

14:12.268 --> 14:14.353
And this! I've been holding onto it.

14:15.312 --> 14:17.565
I must give it for my peace of mind.

14:18.190 --> 14:20.567
SHISUI
MAOMAO

14:20.568 --> 14:21.693
Xiaolan.

14:21.694 --> 14:25.363
She was really down
after you and Shisui disappeared.

14:25.364 --> 14:27.408
She expected a note at least.

14:28.409 --> 14:30.577
Officially, Shisui and I were extracted

14:30.578 --> 14:34.164
and transferred
out of the rear palace, right?

14:34.874 --> 14:35.748
That's right.

14:35.749 --> 14:40.003
However, having a cheerful personality
has its advantages.

14:40.004 --> 14:43.340
She is not especially talented,
but you just can't leave her alone.

14:50.598 --> 14:52.348
Well, take care.

14:52.349 --> 14:54.268
You too, Seki-u.

14:58.939 --> 15:02.317
<i>Lady Seki-u told me all about how</i>

15:02.318 --> 15:03.777
<i>Xiaolan had been doing.</i>

15:05.112 --> 15:06.863
MAOMAO
SHISUI

15:06.864 --> 15:08.157
<i>It seems that after we left,</i>

15:09.074 --> 15:12.327
<i>she couldn't just leave her alone,</i>

15:12.328 --> 15:14.663
<i>working hard all by herself
in the bathhouse.</i>

15:16.832 --> 15:18.167
I see.

15:19.126 --> 15:21.045
Xiaolan is already...

15:30.721 --> 15:33.431
<i>"Maomao, are you doing well?"</i>

15:33.432 --> 15:35.267
<i>I'm doing great.</i>

15:35.893 --> 15:40.021
<i>After completing my apprenticeship,
I left the palace.</i>

15:40.022 --> 15:43.692
<i>The princess who gave me the hair clip
liked me,</i>

15:44.234 --> 15:47.153
<i>she introduced me to her younger sister,
and now</i>

15:47.154 --> 15:48.530
<i>I'm working as her maid.</i>

15:49.865 --> 15:52.785
<i>I intend to give it my all!</i>

15:55.871 --> 15:58.832
<i>I really wish I'd had the chance
to tell you everything properly.</i>

16:04.755 --> 16:08.467
<i>I hope to meet you
and Shisui again someday.</i>

16:09.468 --> 16:12.137
<i>I want to eat frozen treats together
like we used to.</i>

16:23.774 --> 16:28.696
SHISUI

16:32.783 --> 16:33.826
Snow, huh.

16:40.582 --> 16:42.041
<i>They couldn't find</i>

16:42.042 --> 16:45.212
<i>Shisui's body no matter how much
they dug through the snow.</i>

16:47.423 --> 16:51.385
<i>They said they would search again
once the snow melted in spring.</i>

17:03.272 --> 17:04.982
I hope they never find it.

17:10.362 --> 17:12.114
THE VERDIGRIS HOUSE

17:12.781 --> 17:16.452
This new medicine
still doesn't feel quite right.

17:20.622 --> 17:21.873
Oh, okay.

17:21.874 --> 17:23.167
What are you up to?

17:24.752 --> 17:28.504
Lord Jinshi, have you finished your work?

17:28.505 --> 17:30.382
I can take breaks occasionally.

17:33.802 --> 17:36.263
Here you go. Enjoy at your leisure.

17:38.849 --> 17:40.142
<i>What the heck?</i>

17:42.853 --> 17:43.979
<i>He's all healed up.</i>

17:45.022 --> 17:46.648
<i>Did the old man redo the stitches?</i>

17:48.150 --> 17:49.400
You seem tired.

17:49.401 --> 17:51.527
It's not just the personnel affairs,

17:51.528 --> 17:55.616
I'm also dealing with the Shi clan's
territory and various things.

17:57.117 --> 18:01.413
<i>Most of the Shi clan has already
been executed, from what I heard.</i>

18:01.914 --> 18:04.374
<i>Their territory is now
under direct control of the state.</i>

18:05.000 --> 18:09.171
<i>It is rich in forest resources, so
the government should profit handsomely.</i>

18:09.797 --> 18:13.382
<i>If they use the lumber to make paper,
that would be great.</i>

18:13.383 --> 18:16.761
Hey. Stop pretending I am not here.

18:16.762 --> 18:18.639
Sorry, it's a habit.

18:20.349 --> 18:23.684
Never mind.
How about you keep your promise?

18:23.685 --> 18:24.894
Promise?

18:24.895 --> 18:26.980
I gathered the ingredients
for the ice cream, right?

18:27.564 --> 18:29.982
Ice cream? Oh, the hair clip!

18:29.983 --> 18:31.192
What's wrong?

18:31.193 --> 18:34.404
No, it's just, the hair clip...

18:35.322 --> 18:37.032
- I gave it away.
- What?

18:38.200 --> 18:40.618
Maybe I'll find it in the spring.

18:40.619 --> 18:41.870
Why spring?

18:42.913 --> 18:44.915
Or I might not.

18:45.958 --> 18:49.127
It might end up
at some street stall somewhere.

18:49.128 --> 18:52.088
- You sold it off?
- I didn't sell it!

18:52.089 --> 18:54.842
I gave it to Shisui.

18:55.926 --> 18:57.386
To Loulan.

18:57.886 --> 19:01.140
I did say that
I would want it back someday.

19:01.890 --> 19:03.016
I see.

19:03.642 --> 19:07.603
Then, how about you
fulfill the other promise?

19:07.604 --> 19:10.398
"Hear the whole story
before reacting," right?

19:10.399 --> 19:11.358
That's right.

19:13.402 --> 19:15.320
All right then. Go ahead.

19:18.407 --> 19:19.241
Go ahead?

19:21.535 --> 19:22.410
You don't have one?

19:22.411 --> 19:24.745
No, there is,

19:24.746 --> 19:28.708
but, thinking it over, I figure
you already know what I was going to say.

19:28.709 --> 19:32.296
<i>Well, it's too late
to talk about that now.</i>

19:33.088 --> 19:34.965
Then, how about something else instead?

19:35.757 --> 19:36.967
Something else?

19:38.927 --> 19:40.012
<i>So there isn't anything after all?</i>

19:52.774 --> 19:54.610
What are you doing?

19:55.152 --> 19:56.778
Do you get what this means?

19:57.779 --> 20:00.824
You do realize that human saliva
can be poisonous in some cases?

20:02.910 --> 20:05.871
You are immune to most poisons,
are you not?

20:06.580 --> 20:10.292
What? Are you trying to bite me to death?

20:16.673 --> 20:18.550
I feel like doing that.

20:19.259 --> 20:20.135
Wait.

20:21.470 --> 20:23.972
Let us resume from
where we left off at the fortress.

20:30.145 --> 20:31.897
<i>He really is beautiful.</i>

20:36.652 --> 20:40.239
Are you holding some poison inside too?

20:44.743 --> 20:46.244
Freckles!

20:46.245 --> 20:48.704
Look! You wanted this, right?

20:48.705 --> 20:50.332
Oh! Good job!

20:52.292 --> 20:54.086
- It's huge!
- Right?

20:54.878 --> 20:57.339
Why do we always get interrupted?

20:58.173 --> 20:59.508
What's with that guy?

21:01.134 --> 21:02.344
He's just tired.

21:02.970 --> 21:04.554
Here, some brown sugar as a reward.

21:06.098 --> 21:07.182
See ya!

21:11.561 --> 21:13.938
Granny, can you prep a bed?

21:13.939 --> 21:15.649
Make sure it's comfortable.

21:16.566 --> 21:17.776
Got it!

21:22.281 --> 21:25.950
You seem tired, so please rest well.

21:25.951 --> 21:27.327
Got it. I'll rest.

21:29.830 --> 21:31.290
I will use this as my pillow.

21:32.958 --> 21:34.209
Lord Jinshi?

21:37.713 --> 21:40.507
Are you pretending to sleep? Lord Jinshi?

21:45.846 --> 21:47.681
<i>My legs are starting to go numb.</i>

22:15.000 --> 22:17.668
Okay, here's your order.

22:17.669 --> 22:19.128
Thanks for your business!

22:19.129 --> 22:21.214
- Uncle.
- Yes.

22:22.466 --> 22:24.051
Is this a cicada?

22:24.718 --> 22:28.763
Ah, it's a well-made jade
from ancient times.

22:28.764 --> 22:30.890
Oh, jade, huh?

22:30.891 --> 22:32.725
Hey, that's merchandise.

22:32.726 --> 22:35.854
Don't just browse, are you buying or not?

22:36.855 --> 22:38.397
I don't have much money.

22:38.398 --> 22:40.858
Then hands off, all right?

22:40.859 --> 22:44.404
How about a barter? Here, take this.

22:44.988 --> 22:48.324
A hair clip? What is this?

22:48.325 --> 22:50.911
You don't see things like this
around here!

22:52.954 --> 22:53.996
So? Deal?

22:53.997 --> 22:56.248
Where did you get this, young girl?

22:56.249 --> 22:58.459
Never mind! Deal's done!

22:58.460 --> 23:00.170
Then I'll take it!

23:04.341 --> 23:05.842
It's beautiful.

23:09.763 --> 23:11.056
Hey, Uncle!

23:12.432 --> 23:15.059
My name's Tamamo!

23:15.060 --> 23:18.063
"Tamamo" as in Tama for jade
and Mo as in seaweed, huh?

23:18.730 --> 23:21.399
